Now that the film has already become one&nbsp;
of the most iconic offerings of 2023,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.720
Williams is grateful that the&nbsp;
moment was kept in the film's&nbsp;&nbsp;

